section
open Formalism.BasicNotions Formalism.MainNotions.N Formalism.ConjugateSelfDual ReciprocityTheory.Gal NumberField IsDedekindDomain GlobalTheory.IndefiniteRowSideFullHecke.CMTypeEmbeddings Polynomial

